                        ],
                        "form": "vervoeringen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9a8e687a-d411-3658-9b87-24554dfd2cc6",
                        "entry_id": "f279ddcc-9a9b-3a32-8eb9-e848a7c0458c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "toestand waarin men overweldigd wordt door gevoel of hevige gemoedsbeweging"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f38b5e69-8b93-41c0-b6e4-2a8452cc2bd9",
                        "source_entry_id": "f279ddcc-9a9b-3a32-8eb9-e848a7c0458c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9a8e687a-d411-3658-9b87-24554dfd2cc6",
                        "target_lang_word": "Verführung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Verführung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e318e559-d2c7-3ecc-bf9d-c34a7e60294e",
                                        "entry_id": "8ffba912-bbcd-38a8-9f8f-83e5b439abe8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Handlungsweise oder Zustand, die/der jemanden dazu bringen will, etwas zu tun, was diese Person eigentlich nicht will"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a8895c3-34b7-43cf-9ef2-cd0f4ed5ef6a",
                                                "sense_id": "e318e559-d2c7-3ecc-bf9d-c34a7e60294e",
                                                "text": "Das Essen sieht sehr gut aus, einer solchen Verführung kann ich natürlich nicht widerstehen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b334dd-dcc9-4a2e-b18e-319556a08b8c",
                                                "sense_id": "e318e559-d2c7-3ecc-bf9d-c34a7e60294e",
                                                "text": "„Nein, hier geht es nicht um Verführung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e97df51a-f21d-4cd7-9b24-5469a3272eb9",
                                                "sense_id": "e318e559-d2c7-3ecc-bf9d-c34a7e60294e",
                                                "text": "„Die Scham hinderte sie daran, mich offen anzuspornen; sie nahm sich jedoch die Freiheit, ihre Liebkosungen zu verdoppeln und mir Verführung und Grausamkeit vorzuwerfen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4a70544-e878-4dbf-82ba-c01b8df0aa70",
                                                "sense_id": "e318e559-d2c7-3ecc-bf9d-c34a7e60294e",
                                                "text": "„Die Verführung findet statt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c711bfb0-66d3-450d-a0e1-a2f2f05701f5",
                        "source_entry_id": "f279ddcc-9a9b-3a32-8eb9-e848a7c0458c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9a8e687a-d411-3658-9b87-24554dfd2cc6",
                        "target_lang_word": "ecstasy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ecstasy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68d01996-5a09-313a-a7a1-69dbf34d4b21",
                                        "entry_id": "9803d917-ccf2-32ad-ac22-8f7bfc0eeb3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intense pleasure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4399ea1a-36c2-4ab9-ad54-5da66d34e1b1",
                                                "sense_id": "68d01996-5a09-313a-a7a1-69dbf34d4b21",
                                                "text": "In fact, Tarzan had never killed for “pleasure,” nor to him was there pleasure in killing. It was the joy of righteous battle that he loved—the ecstasy of victory."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1a61086-d4a4-496e-beb8-2811816a9095",
                                                "sense_id": "68d01996-5a09-313a-a7a1-69dbf34d4b21",
                                                "text": "This is the very ecstasy of love, / Whose violent property fordoes itself / And leads the will to desperate undertakings / As oft as any passion under heaven / That does afflict our natures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c80b7c6b-ddb6-4335-b600-7fb16ec081e7",
                                                "sense_id": "68d01996-5a09-313a-a7a1-69dbf34d4b21",
                                                "text": "He loved me well, and oft would beg me sing; / Which when I did, he on the tender grass / Would sit, and hearken even to ecstasy,",
                                                "translation": "Comus",
                                                "english": "Comus"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec46fcf1-7420-3998-a0dd-a2ec9c0779d4",
                                        "entry_id": "9803d917-ccf2-32ad-ac22-8f7bfc0eeb3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of emotion so intense that a person is carried beyond rational thought and self-control."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6825d7b-a515-488d-8814-4854f87bf378",
                                                "sense_id": "ec46fcf1-7420-3998-a0dd-a2ec9c0779d4",
                                                "text": "an ecstasy of remorse"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "218efe58-aff7-455a-9ae9-04d997547057",
                                                "sense_id": "ec46fcf1-7420-3998-a0dd-a2ec9c0779d4",
                                                "text": "They were thrown into ecstasies of suspicion by finding that we possessed a French translation of Hitler's Mein Kampf."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cacf2bd-2ca3-31c7-b91f-00c56f258972",
                                        "entry_id": "9803d917-ccf2-32ad-ac22-8f7bfc0eeb3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trance, frenzy, or rapture associated with mystic or prophetic exaltation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f440b02-7509-47c8-9470-d8ff2d1dbea1",
                                                "sense_id": "5cacf2bd-2ca3-31c7-b91f-00c56f258972",
                                                "text": "What! are you dreaming, Son! with Eyes cast upwards / Like a mad Prophet in an Ecstasy?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f0d127d-ea8e-3e35-a9f3-c368acb51dd1",
                                        "entry_id": "9803d917-ccf2-32ad-ac22-8f7bfc0eeb3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Violent emotion or distraction of mind; excessive grief from anxiety; insanity; madness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aea5c79a-e3ce-4f2a-a51f-0320325f330b",
                                                "sense_id": "0f0d127d-ea8e-3e35-a9f3-c368acb51dd1",
                                                "text": "Come, let us leave him; in his ireful mood / Our words will but increase his ecstasy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8bd7ea0-7e66-4dde-be43-fd00571f7c0b",
                                                "sense_id": "0f0d127d-ea8e-3e35-a9f3-c368acb51dd1",
                                                "text": "And I, of ladies most deject and wretched, / That suck'd the honey of his music vows, / Now see that noble and most sovereign reason, / Like sweet bells jangled, out of tune and harsh; / That unmatch'd form and feature of blown youth / Blasted with ecstasy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5a999ce-217a-3ced-bf15-ef8d0d53500c",
                                        "entry_id": "9803d917-ccf2-32ad-ac22-8f7bfc0eeb3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The drug MDMA, a synthetic entactogen of the methylenedioxyphenethylamine family, especially in a tablet form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc062f1c-7438-3fa4-afcb-1a66effaee76",
                                        "entry_id": "9803d917-ccf2-32ad-ac22-8f7bfc0eeb3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state in which sensibility, voluntary motion, and (largely) mental power are suspended, and the body is erect and inflexible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f1c055d-76a1-4569-b14c-70143a2fb8b5",
                                                "sense_id": "fc062f1c-7438-3fa4-afcb-1a66effaee76",
                                                "text": "The instant I drew out my case of instruments, the lady roused herself from her ecstasy, and has never had a similar attack."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "149e6bf8-5d1c-4f54-b204-1ac6d1fa41c4",
                                                "sense_id": "fc062f1c-7438-3fa4-afcb-1a66effaee76",
                                                "text": "Ecstasy bears a strong resemblance to catalepsy: in both cases the patients, during the paroxysm, lose all connexion with the physical world, being deprived of sense and voluntary motion; but in ecstasy, associations of the most pleasing and enchanting nature are established with an ideal existence in an unknown region, which might perhaps be poetically designated the fairy land of an undescried Elysium."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdc7fd43-03c2-42c2-82a0-4dc3001a133a",
                                                "sense_id": "fc062f1c-7438-3fa4-afcb-1a66effaee76",
                                                "text": "In ecstasy the mind is absorbed with some fixed idea, generally of a religious character, and the patient becomes oblivious of surrounding events and objects."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ecstasy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ceaba110-cd44-372c-84c1-ef72a7edafdf",
                                        "entry_id": "906d3339-0ff4-3f96-8f6c-5d1b81ad084e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To experience intense pleasure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "acc468af-08c1-3dc2-a97b-674da679c8b2",
                                        "entry_id": "906d3339-0ff4-3f96-8f6c-5d1b81ad084e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause intense pleasure in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76392708-c32e-40c8-84c4-6baf1f089965",
                                                "sense_id": "acc468af-08c1-3dc2-a97b-674da679c8b2",
                                                "text": "Ali Agha jumped up, seized the visitor by the shoulder, compelled him to sit down, and, ecstasied by the old man's horror at the scene, filled a tumbler, and with the usual grotesque grimaces insisted upon his drinking it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c4d33b7-1d2e-40b7-91a9-3d94bc12e3a2",
                        "source_entry_id": "f279ddcc-9a9b-3a32-8eb9-e848a7c0458c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9a8e687a-d411-3658-9b87-24554dfd2cc6",
                        "target_lang_word": "extase",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "extase",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "decf4368-f25c-3684-a0a7-3ce393adf44a",
                                        "entry_id": "5c85dd73-cd4b-3b1f-9b66-cb2ac123878a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ravissement d’esprit qui, par une contemplation intense, transporte un être hors de la vie des sens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8597a656-bd51-4639-9bcd-451efc509990",
                                                "sense_id": "decf4368-f25c-3684-a0a7-3ce393adf44a",
                                                "text": "Cette sainte avait les yeux levés au ciel, en extase. Toutes ses douleurs parurent suspendues, toute sa vie se rassembla sur sa bouche ; ses lèvres s’entrouvrirent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33728a6f-b25e-499b-af1c-67c51cb22eea",
                                                "sense_id": "decf4368-f25c-3684-a0a7-3ce393adf44a",
                                                "text": "Pendant que le nouveau venu se débitait à lui-même ce monologue, un autre cavalier, […], s’arrêtait et demeurait aussi en extase devant l’enseigne de la Belle-Étoile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80d4f4f0-4bfc-4571-b1ee-43c80b86bed9",
                                                "sense_id": "decf4368-f25c-3684-a0a7-3ce393adf44a",
                                                "text": "Dans cette église, je vis un spectacle qui me frappa : c’était une vieille femme qui rampait sur les genoux, de la porte vers l’autel ; elle avait les bras étendus en croix, roides comme des pieux, la tête renversée en arrière, les yeux retournés et ne laissant voir que le blanc, les lèvres bridées sur les dents, la face luisante et plombée ; c’était de l’extase poussée jusqu’à la catalepsie. Jamais Zurbaran n’a rien fait de plus ascétique et d’une ardeur plus fiévreuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60087bfd-5676-411e-bab5-d185481a2482",
                                                "sense_id": "decf4368-f25c-3684-a0a7-3ce393adf44a",
                                                "text": "Quand il jette en dansant son bruit vif et moqueur,\nCe monde rayonnant de métal et de pierre\nMe ravit en extase, et j’aime à la fureur\nLes choses où le son se mêle à la lumière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fb5920b-ae56-35b0-8a48-2916e85ae7c5",
                                        "entry_id": "5c85dd73-cd4b-3b1f-9b66-cb2ac123878a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vive exaltation qui suspend la sensibilité et la volonté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f952639e-b797-35d7-b8ca-9a5cbee01387",
                                        "entry_id": "5c85dd73-cd4b-3b1f-9b66-cb2ac123878a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Orgasme, plaisir extrême qui absorbe tout autre sentiment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5af95fd4-120b-457a-a476-8e26ec0b4f6e",
                                                "sense_id": "f952639e-b797-35d7-b8ca-9a5cbee01387",
                                                "text": "François se dévoyait auprès des filles publiques, […]. On dit que ces professionnelles ont des charmes secrets, des recettes magiques pour exaspérer la volupté de leurs clients et leur procurer des extases sans pareilles"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23d92512-0a1d-4dd3-9fc4-e029a458be5b",
                                                "sense_id": "f952639e-b797-35d7-b8ca-9a5cbee01387",
                                                "text": "Arès, tu vas vite en besogne car Perséphone est obligée de passer un tiers de l'année auprès d’Hadès, lequel n’ignore rien des extases qu'elle éprouve dans tes bras…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ee47910-4692-4a5c-bff6-7ed92dbaf8b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f279ddcc-9a9b-3a32-8eb9-e848a7c0458c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9a8e687a-d411-3658-9b87-24554dfd2cc6",
